- core/stats/multiple_regression.py: multiple_regression (correlations
  with P, summary ANOVA, Type I in the given order and Type III, parameters,
  VIF, R²/adj R²/AIC/SBC, partial residuals, influence, predictions),
  regression_subsets (all subsets over always-included terms: adj R²,
  AIC, SBC, Mallows' Cp, marginal P), stepwise_selection (forward,
  backward and both stepwise variants with Fin/Fout and cycle detection)
  and model_cross_validation (candidate models by MSEP, MAD, PB).
- New "multi" call kind: response slot y plus all numeric columns aligned
  by row; catalog shows these methods with ≥ 3 numeric columns.
- Tests against Tables 14.1, 14.3, 14.5, 14.7–14.10, 14.12, 14.14, 14.16
  and Example 14.2 (Table A.3 data added).

